{% else %}<section class="zt__hero" aria-labelledby="zt-hero-title">
<div class="zt__wrap zt__hero-grid"><div class="zt__hero-main"><p class="zt__kicker">A CLOSER LOOK AT ZAISEN</p><h1 id="zt-hero-title">You’re not buying a piece of wood. You’re buying a piece of art.</h1><div class="zt__gold-stroke"></div><p class="zt__hero-lead">A wooden piece can be useful. It can also bring warmth, character and a story into your home. Before you choose ZAISEN, we want you to know where our pieces are made, what makes them different and how to reach the people behind them.</p>
<div class="zt__actions"><a class="zt__btn zt__btn--light" href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact">Ask us before you order<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a><a class="zt__text-link zt__text-link--light" href="#zt-craft">Explore our craft <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div><aside class="zt__hero-aside"><span class="zt__monogram" aria-hidden="true">Z</span><p>A small workshop. A thoughtful approach. A real team you can contact.</p><span class="zt__aside-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="zt__tiny">ZAISEN / HANDCRAFTED WOOD</span></aside></div>
<div class="zt__fineprint">REAL WOOD · HANDCRAFTED CHARACTER · HONEST EXPECTATIONS</div></section>
<section id="zt-craft" class="zt__section zt__section--warm" aria-labelledby="zt-why">
<div class="zt__wrap"><div class="zt__section-intro"><p class="zt__kicker">01 / WHAT MAKES ZAISEN DIFFERENT</p><h2 id="zt-why">Craftsmanship you can understand.</h2><p>We believe trust comes from clear information, not oversized promises. Here is what you can expect from us.</p></div><div class="zt__facts"><article class="zt__fact"><span class="zt__number">01 /</span><h3>An actual workshop</h3><p>ZAISEN’s wooden pieces are crafted by our team in our workshop in the Saddar area near Islamabad, Pakistan. We do not describe a warehouse of ready-made wholesale goods as our own handmade production.</p></article><article class="zt__fact"><span class="zt__number">02 /</span><h3>Natural wood, individual character</h3><p>Real wood has grain, colour shifts and markings that make each piece individual. We pay attention to shaping, sanding and finishing. Functional designs may also contain necessary hardware, such as clock mechanisms or lighting components.</p></article><article class="zt__fact"><span class="zt__number">03 /</span><h3>People behind the purchase</h3><p>You can contact our team before placing an order. Ask about materials, sizes, finish, a product you are considering, shipping or the help available if something arrives wrong. We would rather answer clearly than leave you guessing.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="zt__section" aria-labelledby="zt-process">
<div class="zt__wrap"><div class="zt__section-intro"><p class="zt__kicker">02 / HOW A PIECE TAKES SHAPE</p><h2 id="zt-process">From material to meaningful detail.</h2><p>A handcrafted object is the result of many decisions, not an anonymous item selected from a catalogue.</p></div><ol class="zt__steps"><li class="zt__step"><span class="zt__step-n">01</span><div><h3>Consider the wood</h3><p>We begin with the material, its character and the form the design requires.</p></div></li><li class="zt__step"><span class="zt__step-n">02</span><div><h3>Shape and refine</h3><p>Workshop tools and hands-on craftsmanship give the piece its shape and carved details.</p></div></li><li class="zt__step"><span class="zt__step-n">03</span><div><h3>Finish and check</h3><p>Edges, surfaces and functional parts are carefully finished, assembled and checked against the order.</p></div></li><li class="zt__step"><span class="zt__step-n">04</span><div><h3>Protect for the journey</h3><p>The finished item is packed with international transport in mind and prepared for dispatch.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="zt__section zt__section--line" aria-labelledby="zt-honesty"><div class="zt__wrap zt__split"><div><p class="zt__kicker">03 / HONEST PRODUCT PRESENTATION</p><h2 id="zt-honesty">The real piece matters more than the perfect picture.</h2></div><div class="zt__prose"><p>Our listings represent the wooden designs we offer. Some backgrounds, lighting and presentation may be digitally styled, including AI-assisted edits. Natural wood grain and colour also vary. If exact dimensions, materials or additional details matter to you, ask our team before purchasing.</p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/our-story" class="zt__inline-link">View our workshop story ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="zt__section zt__section--warm" aria-labelledby="zt-presence"><div class="zt__wrap"><div class="zt__section-intro"><p class="zt__kicker">04 / VERIFY THE BRAND</p><h2 id="zt-presence">Find us beyond this website.</h2><p>You should not have to rely on one beautiful website alone. Explore our established marketplace presence and use our official contact channels. We show genuine destinations only—never invented customer counts, endorsements or social accounts.</p></div>
<div class="zt__external">
<a class="zt__etsy" href="https://www.etsy.com/shop/ZAISEN" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div><span class="zt__external-label">INDEPENDENT MARKETPLACE / ETSY</span><h3>ZAISEN on Etsy <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>Browse our public Etsy shop, product listings and any customer reviews visible there.</p></div><span class="zt__eyebrow-action">Visit our Etsy shop</span></a>
{% if section.settings.instagram_url != blank or section.settings.facebook_url != blank or section.settings.pinterest_url != blank %}<div class="zt__social"><p>Connect with our official channels</p><div class="zt__social-links">{% if section.settings.instagram_url != blank %}<a href="{{ section.settings.instagram_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a>{% endif %}{% if section.settings.facebook_url != blank %}<a href="{{ section.settings.facebook_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook ↗</a>{% endif %}{% if section.settings.pinterest_url != blank %}<a href="{{ section.settings.pinterest_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pinterest ↗</a>{% endif %}</div></div>{% endif %}</div></div></section>
<section class="zt__section" aria-labelledby="zt-shipping"><div class="zt__wrap zt__split"><div><p class="zt__kicker">05 / WHAT HAPPENS AFTER YOU ORDER</p><h2 id="zt-shipping">From our workshop to your door.</h2></div><div class="zt__prose"><p>We currently ship to seven destinations: the United States, United Kingdom, Germany, France, United Arab Emirates, Canada and Australia. Orders are usually prepared in 1–2 days before dispatch. Estimated transit is 4–5 days to the UK and 8–9 days to the other supported destinations, excluding preparation time. These are estimates, not guaranteed delivery dates.</p><p>Standard shipping is free for qualifying orders from US$60 to the US, UK, Germany, France and UAE, and from US$100 to Canada and Australia. Eligibility is assessed after applicable product discounts; the final shipping charge appears at checkout. Tracking details are shared when available after dispatch.</p><a href="{{ shop.shipping_policy.url }}" class="zt__inline-link">Read shipping details ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="zt__section zt__section--line" aria-labelledby="zt-support"><div class="zt__wrap zt__split"><div><p class="zt__kicker">06 / IF SOMETHING ISN’T RIGHT</p><h2 id="zt-support">Support should continue after checkout.</h2></div><div class="zt__prose"><p>We aim to represent our products honestly and pack them carefully. If your order arrives damaged, defective, incorrect or materially different from its listing, contact us within 14 days of delivery with your order number and clear photos. We review genuine issues and offer a suitable resolution under our refund policy and applicable consumer rights.</p><p class="zt__muted">Natural grain, tone and handmade variations are not automatically defects. Return conditions, costs and remedies depend on the situation and applicable law.</p><a href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url }}" class="zt__inline-link">Read our refund policy ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="zt__section zt__section--warm" aria-labelledby="zt-location"><div class="zt__wrap zt__split"><div><p class="zt__kicker">07 / KNOW WHO YOU ARE BUYING FROM</p><h2 id="zt-location">Open about our workshop. Respectful of your questions.</h2></div><div class="zt__prose"><p>Our production workshop is in the Saddar area near Islamabad, Pakistan. That is where our wooden pieces are made. Our business correspondence location is separate from the workshop; we do not present it as a retail showroom or a place open for customer visits. Legally required business details remain available in our official disclosures.</p><a href="{{ shop.legal_notice.url | default: '/policies/legal-notice' }}" class="zt__inline-link">View our legal information ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="zt__section" aria-labelledby="zt-faq"><div class="zt__wrap zt__faq-layout"><div class="zt__faq-label"><p class="zt__kicker">THE QUESTIONS WORTH ASKING</p><h2 id="zt-faq">Before you place an order.</h2></div><div class="zt__faq-list"><details class="zt__faq" open><summary><span>Are ZAISEN wooden products really handmade?</span><span class="zt__faq-sign" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="zt__faq-answer"><p>Our team shapes and finishes our wooden products in our workshop near Islamabad, Pakistan. We do not simply relabel finished wholesale wooden decor as our own craft. Some functional products also require non-wood parts, which should be listed with the product information.</p></div></details><details class="zt__faq"><summary><span>Can I speak with someone before I purchase?</span><span class="zt__faq-sign" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="zt__faq-answer"><p>Yes. Use our contact page or email support@zaisenstore.com with the product link and your questions. We can clarify listed specifications, materials, delivery estimates and other product details before you order.</p></div></details><details class="zt__faq"><summary><span>Is every ZAISEN product identical to its photographs?</span><span class="zt__faq-sign" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="zt__faq-answer"><p>Natural wood varies in grain, colour and small handmade details. Some listing photos use digitally styled backgrounds or lighting. We aim to show the actual designs sold and invite you to ask if a particular detail is important to your decision.</p></div></details><details class="zt__faq"><summary><span>Where will my order ship from, and can I track it?</span><span class="zt__faq-sign" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="zt__faq-answer"><p>Our wooden products are made in Pakistan and dispatched with international shipping partners. Tracking is provided once available after dispatch. Country-specific delivery estimates and charges are explained in our shipping policy and confirmed at checkout.</p></div></details><details class="zt__faq"><summary><span>What if my product arrives damaged or not as described?</span><span class="zt__faq-sign" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="zt__faq-answer"><p>Please contact us within 14 days after delivery with your order number and photos of the item, plus packaging photos if it was damaged in transit. We assess eligible cases under our refund policy and applicable consumer-protection rights.</p></div></details></div></div></section>
<section class="zt__end" aria-labelledby="zt-end-title"><div class="zt__wrap zt__end-inner"><p class="zt__kicker">NO PRESSURE. JUST CLEAR ANSWERS.</p><h2 id="zt-end-title">Questions before purchasing? Talk to us.</h2><p>Tell us which piece caught your eye. Ask about the wood, dimensions, shipping, packaging or anything else you want to know. We are here to help you choose with confidence.</p><div class="zt__actions zt__actions--center"><a class="zt__btn zt__btn--light" href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact">Contact the ZAISEN team ↗</a><a href="mailto:support@zaisenstore.com" class="zt__text-link zt__text-link--light">Email support@zaisenstore.com ↗</a></div><span class="zt__closing">ZAISEN — nature, shaped by hand.</span></div></section>
